</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As announced on December 07, 2017, the patch adjusted the loot drop chances of this creature.</li>\n<li>As announced on April 18, 2018, the patch increased its armor, HP from 4,200 to 5,400, and damage. Additionally, its <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclopedia\">Bestiary</a> category was changed to \"Hard\".</li>\n<li>As announced on March 24, 2020, the eighth batch of Hunting Ground Rebalancing changed its XP from 2,800 to 2,380, and reduced its drop rate chance by 25%.</li>\n<li>As announced on May 14, 2024, the patch increased experience from 2,380 to 3,380, and increased drop chance of <a href=\"#/wiki/Suspicious%20Device\">Suspicious Device</a> as part of the 2024 Balancing Project.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 2,504 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><i>Empty</i></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.27</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"27.276358\" style=\"text-align:center;\">27%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Cave Devourer Maw\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cave_Devourer_Maw_ec3ae1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Cave Devourer Maw